# Meaning's cost on the web (dynamics grammar plan, G2, F35): run per size
# with ?nodes=<n>&seed=7, once as the page ships (the run sliced over frames)
# and once with ?meaning_slice=0 (the run whole on one frame). Physics is
# paused, so a window times the frame's own work and Meaning's: first a
# baseline with nothing to run, then the frames across Kinds by meaning's
# run, until it lands.
assert snap ready == true
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
click role:button Pause physics
settle 2
assert snap physics-paused == true
assert snap meaning-runs == 0
timing start baseline
settle 60
timing stop
click role:combobox Physics law
settle 1
click role:option Kinds
settle 1
click role:combobox Kinds
settle 1
click role:option By meaning
settle 1
timing start meaning-run
click role:button Apply physics
settle 240
timing stop
assert snap meaning-snapshot-backend == lexical
assert snap meaning-runs == 1
assert snap meaning-pending == false
log meaning cost receipt complete
